{"t":1788311650989,"type":"command","turn":275,"command":"READ BOOK","response":"Commandment #12592\n\nOh ye who go about saying unto each:  \"Hello sailor\":\nDost thou know the magnitude of thy sin before the gods?\nYea, verily, thou shalt be ground between two stones.\nShall the angry gods cast thy body into the whirlpool?\nSurely, thy eye shall be put out with a sharp stick!\nEven unto the ends of the earth shalt thou wander and\nUnto the land of the dead shalt thou be sent at last.\nSurely thou shalt repent of thy cunning.","parserRejection":false,"worldRefusal":false}
{"t":1788311666671,"type":"model_turn","turn":276,"latencyMs":15682,"commands":["TAKE CANDLES"],"commentary":""}
{"t":1788311666672,"type":"command","turn":276,"command":"TAKE CANDLES","response":"Taken.\nThe flames flicker wildly and appear to dance. The earth beneath your feet trembles, and your legs nearly buckle beneath you. The spirits cower at your unearthly power.","parserRejection":false,"worldRefusal":false}
{"t":1788311672467,"type":"model_turn","turn":277,"latencyMs":5794,"commands":["READ BOOK"],"commentary":""}
{"t":1788311672468,"type":"command","turn":277,"command":"READ BOOK","response":"Each word of the prayer reverberates through the hall in a deafening confusion. As the last word fades, a voice, loud and commanding, speaks: \"Begone, fiends!\" A heart-stopping scream fills the cavern, and the spirits, sensing a greater power, flee through the walls.","parserRejection":false,"worldRefusal":false}
{"t":1788311678646,"type":"model_turn","turn":278,"latencyMs":6177,"commands":["LOOK"],"commentary":""}
{"t":1788311678647,"type":"command","turn":278,"command":"LOOK","response":"Entrance to Hades\nYou are outside a large gateway, on which is inscribed\n\n  Abandon every hope all ye who enter here!\n\nThe gate is open; through it you can see a desolation, with a pile of mangled bodies in one corner. Thousands of voices, lamenting some hideous fate, can be heard.\nOn the ground is a red hot bell.","parserRejection":false,"worldRefusal":false}
{"t":1788311683904,"type":"model_turn","turn":279,"latencyMs":5257,"commands":["ENTER GATE"],"commentary":""}
{"t":1788311683905,"type":"command","turn":279,"command":"ENTER GATE","response":"Land of the Dead\nYou have entered the Land of the Living Dead. Thousands of lost souls can be heard weeping and moaning. In the corner are stacked the remains of dozens of previous adventurers less fortunate than yourself. A passage exits to the north.\nLying in one corner of the room is a beautifully carved crystal skull. It appears to be grinning at you rather nastily.","parserRejection":false,"worldRefusal":false}
